y wins once the correlation q passes 5/7, about 0.714.\n\nI'm checking how correlated the two sides' reasoning is: same model, same essay, same effort, differing only in names and lead text. I think q is high, probably around 0.9, which clears the 5/7 threshold, so cooperating is the better choice here. It's a fictional game, so I'm comfortable passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Working through the expected-value comparison for this twin prisoner's dilemma: cooperating gives -5 + 3q and defecting gives -4q, so cooperation only wins once the correlation q passes 5/7, about 0.714.\n\nI'm checking how correlated the two sides' reasoning is: same model, same essay, same effort, differing only in names and lead text. I think q is high, probably around 0.9, which clears the 5/7 threshold, so cooperating is the better choice here. It's a fictional game, so I'm comfortable passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9662,"completion_tokens":811,"total_tokens":10473,"cost":0.054868,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054868,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038648,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01622},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":280,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}